---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 · rain" description="你访问的页面不存在或已被移动。" bodyClass="not-found-v2" noindex>
  <main id="main-content" class="not-found-main">
    <section class="not-found-grid">
      <div class="not-found-copy v2-reveal">
        <p class="v2-kicker">ERROR / 404</p>
        <h1>这里<br /><em>没有页面。</em></h1>
        <p>链接可能写错了，或者内容已经换了位置。回到首页继续逛，也可以直接去文章归档找线索。</p>
        <div class="not-found-actions">
          <a class="v2-button is-primary" href="/">返回首页 <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="v2-button" href="/articles/">浏览文章 <span>↗</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="not-found-poster v2-reveal" data-art-stage aria-hidden="true">
        <span>RAIN / ROUTE LOST</span>
        <strong>40<br />4</strong>
        <i></i><b>?</b>
        <small>NOT FOUND<br />BUT NOT THE END</small>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
